\label{tab:temporal_landscape}
\small
\resizebox{\columnwidth}{!}{%
\begin{tabular}{lcccc}
\toprule
Cohort Definition & $N_{\mathrm{ref}}$ / $N_{\mathrm{focal}}$ & C\% & C\% (web-clean) & Enrich. \\
\midrule
